         • "big book"    → `📖.big`           (NOT `generate:big_book`)
         • "my dog"      → `🐕.my`            (NOT `generate:my_dog`)
         • "two cookies" → `🍪.two`           (NOT `generate:two_cookies`)
         • "cold water"  → `💧.cold`          (NOT `generate:cold_water`)
