              "description": "speech|sentence|fallback|label — same ${T.button} format as rebuild_board. All ${T.button} rules apply (multi-glyph SENTENCEs, MODIFIER SYMBOLs, OPERATORs, fallback when `sentence` uses `generate:`). speech is the first-person SENTENCE the user voices on press. label is the short on-button text. For yes/no questions, use the `yes` / `no` canonical SYMBOLs — they animate on hover and auto-color the ${T.button} green / red without you setting an explicit color. Examples: \"כן|yes||כן\", \"לא תודה|no.please||לא תודה\", \"אני רוצה את התפוח|i_me+want+🍎||תפוח\", \"אני רוצה לשחק בחוץ|i_me+want+play+🌳||בחוץ\"."
